| B1214 proof (c): dump the live spell-emitter registry while an effect plays.
| /macro emfx <spellid> : target self, GM #castspell, then /emdump every 0.5 s.
Sub Main
  /declare i int local
  /target myself
  /delay 5
  /echo B1214E cast spell=${Param0} target=${Target.Name} id=${Target.ID}
  /emdump
  /say #castspell ${Param0}
  /for i 1 to 12
    /delay 5
    /echo B1214E tick ${i}
    /emdump
  /next i
/return
